  <BackstoryDef>
    <defName>HE_Hellas_BS_Orator</defName>
    <title>assembly orator</title>
    <titleShort>orator</titleShort>
    <description>In the assembly [PAWN_nameDef] could turn a vote with a single speech. [PAWN_pronoun] has argued for war, for peace and, once, for both in the same afternoon.</description>
