  <BackstoryDef>
    <defName>HE_Hellas_BS_Strategos</defName>
    <title>elected general</title>
    <titleShort>general</titleShort>
    <description>Three times the citizens elected [PAWN_nameDef] as their general. [PAWN_pronoun] led the phalanx from the front rank and never asked anyone to stand where [PAWN_pronoun] would not.</description>
